    "  name      what the count sheet calls it; also how a recipe ingredient links to it",
    "  category  coffee tea beer wine sake spirits liqueur bitters mixers juice syrup produce",
    "            milk_dairy food packaging other",
    "  unit      each bottle can keg kg gram litre carton pack - the unit you COUNT in",
    "  unitCost  what one unit costs you, GST inclusive, as the supplier bills it",
    "  parLevel  the level you want back to after an order; 0 means never on the reorder list"
  ],
